(50364,0,0,'Far from home, aren\'t you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57298,0,0,'A radish for sweet little Ella? Well, I sure can spare one. Here you go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57385,0,0,'Would that I could, $c, but I have a bit of a weed problem. Say... you wouldn\'t be willing to help out, would you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57402,0,0,'Little Ella\'s trying her hand at brewing? Well, I\'ll be! I wish her luck. Brewing isn\'t something a novice can just take up, you know. Anyhow, I can spare a Lakemelon for her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58646,0,0,'Mmm, that\'s mighty tasty, $n. I wouldn\'t mind another round of that... or two... hic!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58705,0,0,'Awww shucks, I was gonna eat these! Well, if Ella needs \'em, I ain\'t gonna no more. Here, take \'em!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58706,0,1,'I was going to charge you a pretty penny for that peach, but Ella is such a good customer at my market, this one\'s on the house. Just this once, ya hear!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58710,0,0,'Wow! Thish ish shome amazing shtuff! Where can I get shome more?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58712,0,0,'Sure thing, $n! Enjoy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58717,0,0,'Any time, neighbor. Any time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58717,1,0,'Hmmm, this is excellent! EXCELLENT! This is the best stuff I\'ve tasted in a long time. Who brewed it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58718,0,0,'First packet of seeds is on the house! Come back to me anytime you want to buy more seeds, ya hear?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(62377,0,0,'Nothing is free, $r. You want hops, you need to work.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(62385,0,0,'You\'ll have to ask Mung-Mung about that. He maintains our foodstores.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64597,0,0,'Mmmmm, I haven\'t tasted a brew of this complexity and clarity since... well... since the golden age of the Stormstout Brewery! Whoever made this has a real talent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64946,0,0,'Mmmmm. Mmmmmm...... This is... simply put... amazing. Your friend Ella has real talent! Tell her to speak to my Uncle Gao at the Brewery. I think she has found a new home with us Stormstouts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'');
